OL,3,Gwould not do as good a job as I'd like.
OL,5,GI was hoping people might be interested
OL,6,Gin my little gadget. It's a 1541 multi 
OL,7,Gdrive emulator and wifi modem. No need 
OL,8,Gfor a PC. It has 16MB of flash memory  
OL,9,Gonboard. Can hold a lot of             
OL,10,GD64/D71/D81/T64/TCRT/PRG/P00 file      
OL,11,Gimages. It can also access disk images 
OL,12,Gvia HTTP and load them like they were  
OL,13,Gdirectly mounted from flash. You use   
OL,14,Gsimple LOAD commands to connect via    
OL,15,Ghttp, change directories and mount disk
OL,16,Gimages. It doesn't support any fast    
OL,17,Gloaders yet but I'm working on that.   
OL,18,GAll operations at the moment are read  
OL,19,Gonly as well.                          
OL,21,GI also integrated a WebDAV server so   
OL,22,Gyou can connect to it from your        
OL,23,Gcomputer over Wifi and mount it like   
